           {
            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/tb707nd8515#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "No date was read in it, so its figures were not graded. Ink, written across the roll; a name only, no date. Crop 3 is the leader with the printed Welte label 'No. 993. Widmung, Schumann-Liszt. Gespielt von [facsimile signature] 6. XII. 05.' — printed, so the recording date, not a workshop punch date. Crops 2 and 4 blank."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
